    "updated_at": "2022-09-07T00:42:52Z",
    "body": "Curious; I just tried this character on a different Windows machine of mine and it displays like a small x. The two machines are broadly similar, but I'm using Windows 10 and Windows Terminal 1.14.2281.0 on the one where the ✖ is working.\r\n\r\nI noticed on the non-working machine the ✖ looks like a + not just in Terminal but also other apps, including Firefox looking at this very bug report. Something really weird is going on.",
